# What is this?

This is a custom-made PDF viewer based on PDF.js to display the Citizen's Charter (CC) of the Business Permit and Licensing Office (BPLO) of the City Government of Trece Martires (CGO-Trece Martires) in compliance with the Republic Act 11032 or the Ease of Doing Business (EODB) and Efficient Government Service Delivery Act of 2018.

# How does it work?

This app works by using PDF.js modified with basic HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to provide additional (and removal of existing) functionalities to better fit the specifications required by the abovementioned office to be used in a kiosk available to the public.

## This project includes the following features:

    + Display any PDF
    + Modified paginator from PDF.js
    + Basic Navigation
    + Search by Keyword

## Features from PDF.js that was removed for this project:
    
    - Zoom
    - Print
    - Annotations
    - Print
    - Save
    - Document Outline
    - Document Properties
    - Page layout

